    "body": "fix on issue/2990-adaptive-test-budget · PR #3032 · pinned by adaptive_troch_parallel::wide_rectangular_pocket_is_cleared_by_parallel_lanes · merges when reviewed\n\nThe local motion lib baseline took 207.11 seconds on upstream/main 58cb641ca.\nThe final motion lib took 62.51 seconds.\nThe final lib also passed with two test threads in 131.33 seconds.\n\nThe new target times were:\n- adaptive_troch_parallel: 40 seconds.\n- adaptive_troch_island: 109 seconds.\n- adaptive_troch_neck: 111 seconds.\n\nAll 22 adaptive tests remain.\nAll 61 original assertion lines remain.\nThe existing ignored test remains ignored.\n\nThe initial timing pin failed after 178.44 seconds on unchanged fixtures.\nThe final mutation restored the upstream 60x40 fixtures and the D/80 grid.\nIts geometry assertions passed, but its timing assertion failed after 122.38 seconds.\nThe restored pin passed in 40.26 seconds.\n\nThe quick gate passed all 177 steps.\nMotion clippy passed with all targets and warnings denied.\nNo NC or CL goldens changed.\n\nThe issue records a 567-second baseline on the post-merge runner.\nThese local measurements use a different environment.\nThe post-merge runner and the release heavy lanes were not exercised.\nThe PR remains a draft for independent review.\n",
